Farseer 1.4.0, by Badgerson
https://github.com/ViciousBadger/VSMod-Farseer
========================================================================

Adapted from Farseer: the camera far-limit and projection setup of the
distant-terrain renderer; the way the game's own distance haze and sky-colour
fade are applied to distant terrain (the terrain shader includes); and the
horizon silhouette shaders (classic colour, distance fade, near sink and globe
curve). The seam fog that hides the join between the game's terrain and this
mod's terrain is this project's own design and is not taken from Farseer.

